  "description": "Desktop bridges for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge app, backed by Shiny.Maui.Controls.Desktop: system tray and menu bar icons the page owns (menus, badges, notifications, animation), and quick entry — a prompt window that opens over other applications from a global hotkey, with suggestions, a response area and a screen-edge glow. What the user does goes to the page, or to background.js with the window closed. Desktop only: macOS (AppKit and Catalyst), Windows and Linux. builder.AddTrayIconBridge().AddQuickEntryBridge().",
